{"v":4,"catch":"這是一款旨在奪回生物失去的色彩的動作遊戲。","desc":"奔跑，與敵人碰撞，享受旋轉敵人的刺激動作。\n\n它具有使用地板的各種動作，例如抬起地板、投擲地板、將其用作盾牌、滑翔、割草、在水面上行走以及放置地雷。\n此外，擊敗敵方首領的方式也有些不同。\n\n物品可以增強玩家的或擴大探索範圍。","publisher":"G2PLHAS","release":"2024-06-20","genres":["動作","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.5GB / Switch 0.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3a24d936d9c7a002f0ca5cc69833e0115f0a1972642a9e7329747a259a0e47fe.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2d484451fd9c1633fb9fd6a654b3036a2975777079ac4cde4a5de541a133f560.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/368085aaa3ff2c26a4a75bc5d88c8e43dc639326895bec9cf114a7344b927b1f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/32e1e7529ec82f9d2f4e3d3fae95d4e671b45ca9da58753bd1400cf0a391a0de.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a5c3c5c66adf88bf9638ae42fdf9c85dccbda06e0116be4232225b3a01febfe5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ac4f9b6f61fe02ba803a35ab821624effd2ecfba9e9a53aa520670e37172754d.jpg"],"titleId":"01007da01f060000","dlc":[]}